growth company <span id="xdx_901_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260710__20260710_zCwHRUGpzef"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-07-10" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

