<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Proposal
3. Shareholders approved amendments to the company&#8217;s certificate of incorporation authorizing the MicroVision Board of Directors
to effect a reverse stock split at a ratio of not less than 1-for-5 and not more than 1-for-15, and simultaneously reduce authorized
shares to 150 million, with the exact ratio and effective time of the reverse stock split, if any, to be determined by our Board of Directors
at any time within one year of the date of the 2026 Annual Meeting.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

